---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <section class="intro">
    <p>
      I'm interested in machine learning and deep learning, both in research and
      its applications. I hold two cum laude master's degrees: Artificial Intelligence at
      the University of Amsterdam, and Econometrics and Operations Research at the Vrije
      Universiteit Amsterdam. I previously interned at <a href="https://wair.ai">WAIR</a>,
      a retail forecasting scale-up.
    </p>
    <p>
      My interests include geometric deep learning, mechanistic interpretability, and time
      series modelling, from classical statistics to foundation models. This
      site is where I document my work, because I enjoy communicating the things I'm
      excited about.
    </p>
    <p>
      I used to row competitively as a student athlete, and I bring that work ethic and
      collaborative attitude to everything I do.
      Feel free to <a href="mailto:freek.byrman@gmail.com">reach out</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro { font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .intro p { margin: 0 0 0.9rem; }
  .intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
</style>
